---
/** Shared wrapper for legal pages. */
---

<section class="section theme-dark">
  <div class="container legal">
    <p class="todo">
      <strong>Template text.</strong> Have this page drafted or reviewed by a legal professional for every market UKEMI sells in
      (e.g. GDPR for the EU/UK, CCPA for California) before launch.
    </p>
    <slot />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .legal {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 760px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .legal :global(h2) {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
